30	  // The account-detail screen: inspection and repair for ONE account on ONE relay —
31	  // identity facts, usage/storage, email correction, and reset-token issuance. Reached from the accounts
32	  // list (`?server=…&did=…`) and pinned to a single pairing at entry (see
33	  // $lib/pinned-pairing) like Devices/Moderation. Nothing here signs: destructive work
34	  // (takedown/restore, credential revocation) lives one hop deeper on the moderation
35	  // screen, reached from here with the same pin + DID. Repair writes use the shared
